      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Kafka Topic: customer-login\n        │\n        ▼\nKafka Consumer\n(LoginEventListener)\n        │\n        ▼\nLoginProcessingService\n        │\n        ├── REST call → customer-\ntracking-service\n        │\n        ▼\nResult (successful/unsuccessful)\n        │\n        ├── Publish event → Kafka topic:\nlogin-tracking-result\n        │\n        ▼\nPersist entity → Database",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "JXV494yDy_tWAN3xN9SiT",
      "originalText": "Kafka Topic: customer-login\n        │\n        ▼\nKafka Consumer\n(LoginEventListener)\n        │\n        ▼\nLoginProcessingService\n        │\n        ├── REST call → customer-tracking-service\n        │\n        ▼\nResult (successful/unsuccessful)\n        │\n        ├── Publish event → Kafka topic: login-tracking-result\n        │\n        ▼\nPersist entity → Database",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
